{"timestamp":"2026-08-17T10:28:58.493Z","ordinal":37400,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a00e33-28bf-7050-b2f6-2b374830398b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a82e268f13c81988b4f9bf8ca9d21a3","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ve settled the prototype: the impact page is the confirmation surface, deactivation is reversible and idempotent, existing occurrences are counted but never mutated, inactive templates disappear only from the manual generator (not from staff history), and both generator paths fail closed after locking/re-reading the template. I’m encoding those invariants as the red tests now."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786962536990,"completed_at_ms":1786962538493}}
