{"timestamp":"2026-08-17T12:37:01.529Z","ordinal":39264,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a00e33-28bf-7050-b2f6-2b374830398b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a83006b7d0481988b9f9487fe05c07d","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The failure is CI-only and precise: the seed runs `ts-node` without the app’s `@/` alias resolver, and the new lock helper imported Prisma through that alias. The focused fix is a one-line relative import in the same module; the existing authorization to get this PR passing covers it. I’ll reproduce the CI seed step locally, re-run the reachable verification/review, push, and watch the new exact head."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786970219525,"completed_at_ms":1786970221529}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-17T12:37:01.535Z","ordinal":39265,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_00fb20eee1c75140016a83006b7d0481988b9f9487fe05c07d","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The failure is CI-only and precise: the seed runs `ts-node` without the app’s `@/` alias resolver, and the new lock helper imported Prisma through that alias. The focused fix is a one-line relative import in the same module; the existing authorization to get this PR passing covers it. I’ll reproduce the CI seed step locally, re-run the reachable verification/review, push, and watch the new exact head."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a00e33-28bf-7050-b2f6-2b374830398b"}}}
